<title>USA: RLI Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>RLI Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.89		    $0.85</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.78		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net			  7,002		    6,694</p>
<p> Gross sales	     75,610		   71,496</p>
<p> Total rev		 40,721		   38,568</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 7,843		    7,851</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 9,612		    9,620</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 3.25		    $1.01</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.85		    $1.01</p>
<p> Net			 25,696		    7,950</p>
<p> Gross sales	    301,500		  293,922</p>
<p> Total revs	     155,394		  155,954</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 7,896		    7,850</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 9,666		    7,850</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 results include one-time charge of $733,000, or $0.06/shr for the effect of the change from pooling of purchase accounting stemming from a 1995 acquisition by RLI Vision Corp. Prior years' data for RLI Corp was restated to reflect the equity method of accounting.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
